Subject: [PATCH 1/2] dt-bindings: remoteproc: qcom,wcnss-pil: Add WCN3660A
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Describe WCN3660A as a distinct RF variant. Its regulator requirements
match WCN3620/WCN3680; keep its identity distinct from WCN3680.

Refresh Matti Lehtimäki's original implementation from 9587367f58f6
on the current remoteproc integration base. Keep current upstream
allocation/error handling and all pre-existing RF entries unchanged.

Refreshed with OpenAI Codex assistance. Human review and DCO
certification remain pending.
---
 Documentation/devicetree/bindings/remoteproc/qcom,wcnss-pil.yaml | 1 +
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+)

diff --git a/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/remoteproc/qcom,wcnss-pil.yaml b/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/remoteproc/qcom,wcnss-pil.yaml
index a55e55f5f..3ef24133e 100644
--- a/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/remoteproc/qcom,wcnss-pil.yaml
+++ b/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/remoteproc/qcom,wcnss-pil.yaml
@@ -117,6 +117,7 @@ properties:
         enum:
           - qcom,wcn3620
           - qcom,wcn3660
+          - qcom,wcn3660a
           - qcom,wcn3660b
           - qcom,wcn3680
 
